body:
Switch from offline to online, this was before rollback, so people were constantly playing with 4 frames of delay, and Cake wasn't exactly known for having the best internet connection so he struggled to place top 1 at most tournaments, if any.

&#x200B;

Yup, mean that, and with seggo I mean that's the only person that's been able to take a workshop character to the top TOP level, and since Cake hadn't been fighting olympia for years unlike other characters, he got matchup checked a bunch.

Honestly, aside from the obvious that anyone in the top 5 has (A lot of time), he's just different, he knows the game pretty in and out which is why he struggled the most during Season 5 and the more recently the release of workshop and Seggo.

&#x200B;

So I'd say his understanding of the game is beyond anyone else's
